WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.584
It is one day until my birthday.

2
00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:06.610
The invitation cards have been sent.

3
00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:09.938
Mom will prepare the food.

4
00:00:09.939 --> 00:00:13.759
Hana: Mom, tomorrow is the big

5
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.969
day. Mom: I

6
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.412
know. What would you like for your birthday meal?

7
00:00:17.413 --> 00:00:19.553
Hana: My favorites!

8
00:00:19.554 --> 00:00:25.069
Barbecued chicken, spaghetti, and kimbab , please.

9
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.022
Mom: What about a cake?

10
00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:29.862
Hana: Oh, yeah. A cake too.

11
00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.527
Bada: I want a yummy ice cream cake.

12
00:00:33.528 --> 00:00:36.047
Hana: It's not your birthday,

13
00:00:36.048 --> 00:00:40.305
Bada. Mom, I would like a chocolate cake please.

14
00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:43.809
Mom: Sure. How many do you expect?

15
00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:49.037
Hana: Hmm, about 9 to 11 people.

16
00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:50.218
Mom: I see.

17
00:00:50.219 --> 00:00:55.897
Well, let's go grocery shopping then. Bada:

18
00:00:55.898 --> 00:00:58.878
Are you going to buy the cake now? Mom:

19
00:00:58.879 --> 00:01:00.874
I will do that tomorrow.

20
00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:05.280
Hana: Let's go, Hada!

21
00:01:05.281 --> 00:01:09.361
We put up many pretty balloons in the living room.

22
00:01:09.362 --> 00:01:16.879
That night I dreamed a wonderful dream.

